Find the ordered pair $(x,y)$ of positive integers less than 97 satisfying the following system of congruences modulo 97:
$\left\{
\begin{aligned}
x^{\log_5 a} &\equiv 45 \pmod{97} \\
\frac{x}{y} &\equiv a \pmod{97}
\end{aligned}
\right.$
where $a$ is a fixed integer derived from the context of this specific problem instance.
